ytdownloader (0.2.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Invidious-style URLs accepted (inv.nadeko.net, invidious.tiekoetter.com, ...).
  * Full title shown on validation; downloads start only via explicit
    "Download now" / "Add to queue" buttons.
  * Completed downloads shown; not restored on startup.
  * Remove (✕) buttons on queued, active, and completed rows.
  * Pause all button; paused state persists across restarts.
  * Quit dialog notes auto-resume on next start; Shift+Ctrl+Q exits without prompting.
  * Help menu shows version.
  * Automatic state save (periodic + on exit) with restore on startup.

