ytdownloader (0.1.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Linux Mint LMDE 7 (Debian 12 bookworm).
  * Qt graphical YouTube audio/video downloader using yt-dlp.
  * Features: validation, queuing, parallel downloads, auto-retry with
    exponential backoff, completion verification, progress reporting.

